# Bot1 activates Mistrise Village on turn 3 and casts nothing that turn. The effect lasts "this turn" (CR 611.2a, 514.2):
# it is gone at cleanup, so the Lightning Bolt Bot1 casts on turn 5 is the first spell of a new turn and is countered by
# Bot2's Counterspell as any spell is. Compare the sibling scenario where the Bolt is cast the turn the ability resolves.

